[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9367.91, "timestamp": "02:36:07", "text": "空間？クローンコードを作成できないのはなぜですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9369.79, "timestamp": "02:36:09", "text": "スペース"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9377.429, "timestamp": "02:36:17", "text": "入れないならそれでいい。おお、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9386.27, "timestamp": "02:36:26", "text": "わかった。だから、私はできるから、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9388.51, "timestamp": "02:36:28", "text": "何をする"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9391.63, "timestamp": "02:36:31", "text": "コマンドのために再度"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9393.95, "timestamp": "02:36:33", "text": "クローン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9397.67, "timestamp": "02:36:37", "text": "クローンを取得するのは親指ではないよ、兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9409.309, "timestamp": "02:36:49", "text": "できません。そしてこれらは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9417.1, "timestamp": "02:36:57", "text": "わかった。えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9418.349, "timestamp": "02:36:58", "text": "[音楽]"}]